'**Round One** is the pre-judged **research paper**, uploaded as **one PDF** by **May 15**, worth **90 points**. Everyone who uploads receives a **Round Two** appointment: a **speech of up to five minutes** (new for 2026–27), worth **80 points**, for a total of **170**.',
'In the speech, notecards are allowed (electronic notes are not shown), but **no other props or materials—including the research paper**—are allowed.',
'Wear business attire or the official HOSA uniform for bonus points.',
'The speech may elaborate on the paper, but its main ideas must stay the same.',
