'The **body** is **two pages**, one-sided and typed, in **12-point Arial**, **double-spaced**, in English, with **1-inch margins** on 8½″ × 11″ paper, a **running header** with your last name and the event name at the top left and the **page number** at the top right (not on the title page).',
'References should be in **APA** style; formatting of references is not judged, but a clean, legible reference page earns points. **No plagiarism**—the work must be your own.',
